WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.320
Welcome to the Man of Recaps. This is&nbsp;
the live action One Piece, season one.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:09.540
Welcome to a world that is mostly ocean, and so&nbsp;
naturally, it's full of pirates. 20 years ago,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.540 --> 00:00:13.560
the Pirate King Gold Roger was captured, but&nbsp;
with his last words, he told the crowd of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:17.280
his hidden treasure hoard. They call it the One&nbsp;
Piece because I guess it's all in one piece?
&nbsp;

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:21.660
Gold Roger was executed, but he inspired a whole&nbsp;
new generation to become pirates and hunt for the One Piece.

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:26.400
20 years later, no one has found&nbsp;
it, so we follow a new hopeful, Monkey D Luffy.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:31.440
He's a happy-go-lucky energetic youngster, with&nbsp;
unshakable confidence that he will find the One&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:35.400
Piece and become the new king of the pirates!
He's not off to a very good start, as his boat&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:39.360
sinks and he's picked up by the evil pirate&nbsp;
Alvida. Yeah, by the way, there are no normal&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:43.740
pirates on this show, they all have to have&nbsp;
some wild theme. A prisoner on the ship is the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.740 --> 00:00:48.060
unconfident Koby, but Luffy befriends him and&nbsp;
stands up for him. Luffy is a decent fighter,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.060 --> 00:00:52.440
especially because he has stretchy powers!
Yes, as a kid he ate a "Devil Fruit" that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.440 --> 00:00:55.020
turned his body into rubber. So&nbsp;
he calls out his finishing move,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:55.020 --> 00:00:59.340
"Gum Gum Pistol!" and knocks Alvida out of&nbsp;
there. Yeah he wants to be a *good* pirate,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:03.420
like his childhood idol, Red Haired Shanks, who&nbsp;
saved him from a sea monster but lost his arm.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:07.260
Shanks gave Luffy his iconic straw hat, like "Come&nbsp;
find me when you're a famous pirate yourself."
&nbsp;

00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:11.400
Now to find the One Piece Luffy needs a map, and&nbsp;
maps are pretty rare in this world, so they go&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:14.700
to a Marine base to try to steal one. But here&nbsp;
he meets a couple other characters with anime&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:19.080
main character energy, because they have brightly&nbsp;
colored hair. There's the pirate hunter, Zoro, a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:22.860
master swordsman who carries three swords, but he&nbsp;
only pulls the third out for special occasions.
&nbsp;

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:26.640
He gets in a fight with the spoiled son of the&nbsp;
Marine commander, which lands him in jail. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:26.640 --> 00:01:29.880
as Luffy sneaks into the Marine base, he&nbsp;
gives him his spiel, "I'm Monkey D Luffy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:33.120
going to be King of the Pirates" and sets him&nbsp;
free, "You should join my crew." Also sneaking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:33.120 --> 00:01:37.020
into the Marine base is the orange haired Nami,&nbsp;
who's a thief looking to steal a map herself.
&nbsp;

00:01:37.020 --> 00:01:40.500
The map they need is a real special one kept&nbsp;
in the commander's safe, and long story short,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:44.040
they get it out there. But now they got to fight&nbsp;
the whole Marine base, all three of them working&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:48.720
together, Luffy's crew has assembled! Though&nbsp;
Nami and Zoro don't admit it yet. But now they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.720 --> 00:01:52.560
fight the commander himself, Axe Hand Morgan,&nbsp;
who does indeed have an axe for a hand. 
&nbsp;

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:57.300
For the boss fight Zoro pulls out his third sword,&nbsp;
which he holds in his mouth! Which is utterly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:57.300 --> 00:02:01.260
ridiculous, but he makes it work. As they make&nbsp;
their escape, Koby's not coming. He doesn't want&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:05.400
to be a pirate, he wants to be a Marine! Luffy's&nbsp;
biggest thing is supporting people following their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:08.820
dreams, so "We may be on opposite sides of the&nbsp;
law, but I know we can still be friends."
&nbsp;

00:02:08.820 --> 00:02:13.320
So Luffy and friends sail away and they become&nbsp;
known as the Straw Hat Pirates. Now, what makes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.320 --> 00:02:17.820
this map so special? Navigator Nami explains:&nbsp;
the Ocean World is divided into four quadrants,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.820 --> 00:02:21.780
with a big strip of land running down the middle.&nbsp;
And around the equator is the "Grand Line",&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:25.800
the most wild, untamed, dangerous place on the&nbsp;
planet! The map they stole is the only known&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:30.480
map of the Grand Line, so it's very special.
So our little crew has got the attention of Marine&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:36.240
Vice Admiral, Garp - and yes, by the way, phones&nbsp;
in this show are snails - and also Garp's hat is a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:40.260
dog. He's going to lead a squad of new recruits to&nbsp;
hunt down these Straw Hat Pirates, including Koby,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:44.760
and Axe Hand's son, who now has an atrocious&nbsp;
haircut given to him by Zoro when he escaped.
&nbsp;

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:48.900
And it's not just the Marines, other pirates&nbsp;
are after them too, the first of which is Buggy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:53.520
the clown pirate. And Buggy's kind of funny,&nbsp;
but he's also bad. And he recognizes Luffy's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:57.900
straw hat. Yes, he used to be friends with&nbsp;
Shanks, but it didn't end well. And Luffy can't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:02.280
just beat this guy with his stretchy powers,&nbsp;
because Buggy ate a Devil Fruit too!The Chop&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:06.180
Chop Fruit that lets him break into pieces.
He puts Luffy in a sea water tank, yes that's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:10.500
the problem with Devil Fruit, seawater nullifies&nbsp;
your powers and makes you weak. But Luffy's crew&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:13.620
breaks him out of there and they figure out&nbsp;
to lock Buggy's parts in the different chests,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:16.200
so now he's no longer a threat.
Now our crew needs a new boat,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:20.580
and Luffy can't steal one, "Stealing is wrong"&nbsp;
- I'm not sure he knows what a pirate is. At&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:24.960
Luffy's favorite boat he meets Usopp, a guy who&nbsp;
exaggerates every story he tells. He claims he's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:28.620
best friends with the boat's owner, but turns&nbsp;
out it's true, it's the young woman Kaya. She&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:31.860
loves the obviously fake stories of the great&nbsp;
Captain Usopp, because they make her laugh.
&nbsp;

00:03:31.860 --> 00:03:35.940
She invites them to stay for her birthday dinner,&nbsp;
but her butler does not approve, and soon spirits&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:40.260
her away because of her poor health. But turns&nbsp;
out he is the pirate Kuro, leader of the Black&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.260 --> 00:03:43.620
Cat Pirates! And Kaya's not really sick,&nbsp;
he's been slowly poisoning her this whole&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:47.520
time as an evil plan to take all her money.
Usopp fights with his signature slingshot,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:51.720
but Kuro's super fast - oh, he ate a Devil Fruit&nbsp;
too! Usopp Tries to warn the village of the pirate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.720 --> 00:03:54.900
invasion, but they don't listen to him, it's the&nbsp;
boy who cried wolf because his whole life he's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:54.900 --> 00:03:57.960
been saying the pirates are coming. When he was&nbsp;
a kid, his dad left to become a pirate, and he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:57.960 --> 00:04:01.500
always hoped that his dad would come back.
And turns out Luffy knows Usopp's Dad,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:05.520
he was part of Shanks' crew! But Koby's here&nbsp;
with the novice Marines, but Kuro convinces him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:09.360
that Usopp's a liar. He hands over Luffy though,&nbsp;
who is mostly dead, because he drank the entire&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:14.040
poison soup! Yeah, Luffy's favorite thing is food.&nbsp;
But now Luffy barfs it up, he's totally fine.
&nbsp;

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:17.160
So Luffy steps in to fight this&nbsp;
guy, and he's normally a happy kid,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:21.540
but the one thing you don't do is mess with&nbsp;
his friends! So Luffy goes into beast mode,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:26.520
"Gum Gum Bell!" and knocks this guy out of here!&nbsp;
As thanks for saving her Kaya gives them the boat,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:30.660
and Usopp's going to come join the crew, have the&nbsp;
real adventures of the great Captain Usopp - even&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:30.660 --> 00:04:34.260
though Luffy of course is the real captain.
But now the Marines have caught up to them and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:34.260 --> 00:04:38.640
when Luffy sees Garp, he says "Grandpa?" Yes,&nbsp;
young Luffy always wanted to be a pirate,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.640 --> 00:04:43.860
but his Vice Admiral Grandpa did not approve,&nbsp;
so yes this hunt is a family feud. Luffy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:47.940
bounces the cannonball back so they escape.
They come to the pirate restaurant, Baratie,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:51.600
which is of course Luffy's dream. And&nbsp;
back in the kitchen is a master chef,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:55.560
it's Sanji. But his boss doesn't approve of him&nbsp;
going off menu, so he makes him a waiter today,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:59.520
where he meets our crew and flirts with Nami.
But now Garp sends someone else after Luffy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:04.320
a pirate himself, Dracule Mihawk. He's&nbsp;
one of the Seven Warlords of the Sea,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:07.860
legendary pirates that are pardoned by the World&nbsp;
Government because it's too hard to go after them,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:11.760
and better to let them take out other pirates.&nbsp;
Mihawk is famously the greatest swordsman alive,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:11.760 --> 00:05:16.500
so Zoro stands up and challenges him to a duel.&nbsp;
That's his backstory, he made a vow with his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:20.040
best friend to become the greatest swordsman&nbsp;
alive, but she died in a tragic accident,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:23.400
and that's his third sword, it belonged to her.
So to prove he's the best, he's got to beat&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:27.960
Mihawk, but Mihaawk pulls out his tiny little&nbsp;
knife, and yeah this guy's on a whole other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:31.980
level! Even with Zoro's third mouth-sword,&nbsp;
he beats him handily, breaks his other two.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.980 --> 00:05:36.720
But Zoro's pretty good, so Mihawk slashes him&nbsp;
just deep enough that he'll live, "Come find&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:36.720 --> 00:05:40.800
me again when you're ready." As for Luffy, he's&nbsp;
interested by this kid's spark, "I'm going to let&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:44.700
you go and see what you get up to."
But now hunting Luffy is the pirate Arlong,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:44.700 --> 00:05:49.560
captain of the Fishmen Crew. He tracked Luffy&nbsp;
here because he found Buggy's head, who had an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.560 --> 00:05:53.220
ear in Luffy's hat the whole time! And Luffy&nbsp;
can't beat Arlong, Fishmen are really strong,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:58.680
and pretty soon things look bleak. But he saved&nbsp;
by Nami, who's like "Hey Arlong, I got the map for&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:58.680 --> 00:06:03.180
you." Oh! She's been on his crew this whole&nbsp;
time! But Luffy doesn't believe Nami really&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:03.180 --> 00:06:06.060
betrayed them, he knows there's something else&nbsp;
going on, and is going to go to rescue her.
&nbsp;

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:09.900
And sailing out with them is the suited chef,&nbsp;
Sanji. His dream is to find the All Blue,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:13.980
a legendary restaurant with ingredients from all&nbsp;
four Seas. As a kid he was captured by his future&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:17.100
boss, who at the time was the captain&nbsp;
of the dreaded Chef Pirates. When their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:20.160
ship sank they were marooned together,&nbsp;
they split up the food, the adult took&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:20.160 --> 00:06:23.220
the bigger bag because he's an adult.
But turns out there was no food in there,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:23.220 --> 00:06:28.260
he gave it all to Sanji, and to survive, ate&nbsp;
his own leg! Yes Chef Zeff is a real good guy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:28.260 --> 00:06:32.220
and these two fight constantly, but they love&nbsp;
each other. So we go to Arlong's headquarters&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:32.220 --> 00:06:36.960
at the ruined Coco Village, which was where a&nbsp;
young Nami grew up, until Arlong invaded and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:41.400
killed her mother! But then Nami betrayed&nbsp;
her people and joined ArLong's crew! Now&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:41.400 --> 00:06:44.700
she comes and collects tribute from them.
"There's something up, Nami, I know you're a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:44.700 --> 00:06:48.420
good person." She claims not to be, but of&nbsp;
course she is. She joined Arlong's crew as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:51.540
part of a promise that if she gave him one&nbsp;
hundred million "Berry" - that's their word&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:54.720
for money by the way - she could buy back&nbsp;
Coco Village and he'd leave it in peace.
&nbsp;

00:06:54.720 --> 00:06:59.100
And finally, Nami's collected enough, but Arlong&nbsp;
goes back on the deal, sends the Marines on his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:59.100 --> 00:07:03.540
payroll after her! So Nami is devastated, goes&nbsp;
to cut off her tattoo, but her Captain Luffy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:06.600
is there to help her. "You're going to help&nbsp;
me even though I betrayed you?" And he puts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:06.600 --> 00:07:11.160
his straw hat on her, "Of course I will."
So the Straw Hat Pirates bust into Arlong's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:14.820
pool party, and it's a big anime&nbsp;
fight, Hyah, Hyah! Sanji, by the way,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:14.820 --> 00:07:19.320
only fights by kicking. Buggy agreed to help them&nbsp;
if they get his body back, but he was lying, He&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:23.760
peaces out. Luffy goes to fight Arlong, and he's&nbsp;
real mad that he messed with his friend Nami.
&nbsp;

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:27.720
Arlong's still way too strong, Luffy can't win,&nbsp;
but it's the maps that Nami had drawn for him that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:27.720 --> 00:07:31.680
will let him rule the seas and start a Fishman&nbsp;
empire. So Luffy's going to destroy his map room,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:38.040
and he goes for the epic big kick, "Gum&nbsp;
Gum Battle Axe!" Woah! Knocks Arlong all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:41.880
the way down, destroys the whole building!
But it's not over yet, because Grandpa's caught&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:41.880 --> 00:07:45.720
up to him. Koby steps forward, "Hey, Luffy's&nbsp;
clearly the good guy here, I refuse to follow&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:45.720 --> 00:07:49.800
orders." Bad Haircut joins too, he's become kind&nbsp;
of a better person and best friends with Koby.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:55.080
But Garp doesn't need them, he'll do it himself,&nbsp;
because oh, Grandpa packs a big wallop! He grabs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:55.080 --> 00:08:00.420
his grandson, "Stop fooling around!" But Monkey D&nbsp;
Luffy knows exactly who he is: he's going to find&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:00.420 --> 00:08:04.860
the One Piece and become King of the Pirates!
So Garp gives up, "All right, kid, you win.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:08.100
I'm proud of you at least for following&nbsp;
your own dream. But next time I see you,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.100 --> 00:08:12.660
I'll have to arrest you." Because indeed, Luffy&nbsp;
has achieved one dream, he finally got his own&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:16.260
wanted poster! He says goodbye to his Marine&nbsp;
friend Koby, they've realized that there can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:16.260 --> 00:08:20.760
be bad Marines and good pirates, so they both&nbsp;
vow to be good. And Garp was impressed that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:20.760 --> 00:08:24.360
stood up for what's right, so he's taking the Bad&nbsp;
Haircut Duo to be his personal apprentices.
&nbsp;

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:28.140
But Luffy's new fame makes him a big target for&nbsp;
all his former villains, who he doesn't kill,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:28.140 --> 00:08:31.980
so they can all come back. And also watch&nbsp;
out for a mysterious figure who smokes two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.980 --> 00:08:35.700
cigars at the same time! And also watch&nbsp;
out for the bad guy group Baroque Works,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:38.880
who tried to recruit Zoro at the beginning of&nbsp;
the season but he turned them down. But Luffy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:42.870
has friends out there too, like Red Haired Shanks,&nbsp;
who is still alive. Mihawk visits him like "Hey I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:42.870 --> 00:08:47.580
met Luffy," and look he's become a real pirate!
And our crew has become a family, they all make&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:53.280
a vow to follow their dreams. And the Straw Hat&nbsp;
Pirates unveil their new flag, yeah the smiling&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:58.500
skeleton with the straw hat. So Monkey D Luffy is&nbsp;
really doing it, going to go to the Grand Line,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.500 --> 00:09:03.300
find the One Piece and become King of the Pirates!&nbsp;
And that's where season one comes to an end.
&nbsp;

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:09.240
If you like this recap, hit that subscribe button,&nbsp;
for more of the best recaps of TV and movies.

